{"id":47893,"date":"2026-01-10T06:40:14","date_gmt":"2026-01-10T05:40:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47893"},"modified":"2026-09-27T14:34:33","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T13:34:33","slug":"mangualde-trail-desafio-dos-santos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/mangualde-trail-desafio-dos-santos\/","title":{"rendered":"Mangualde Trail \u2013 Desafio dos Santos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mangualde Trail \u2013 Desafio dos Santos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Mangualde Trail \u2013 Desafio dos Santos 2026<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) \u00e9 um emocionante evento de corrida de montanha e caminhada no cora\u00e7\u00e3o da Beira Alta, organizado pelo <strong>Montanha Clube Mangualde<\/strong> com o apoio institucional do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Mangualde<\/strong>. Realizando-se no domingo, <strong>25 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, a prova integra o calend\u00e1rio outonal associado \u00e0s celebra\u00e7\u00f5es e esp\u00edrito festivo da secular Feira dos Santos, convidando todos a desfrutarem dos trilhos e patrim\u00f3nio natural do concelho de <strong>Mangualde<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Constituindo a 8\u00aa etapa do conceituado <strong>Circuito de Trail da Beira Alta \u2013 VI(r)VER BEIRA ALTA<\/strong>, o evento disponibiliza quatro percursos equilibrados: o competitivo <strong>Trail Longo de 25 km<\/strong> (com cerca de 1.000 m D+), o acess\u00edvel <strong>Trail Curto de 15 km<\/strong> (com cerca de 500 m D+), o r\u00e1pido <strong>Mini-Trail de 8 km<\/strong> (com 250 m D+) e uma participada <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong>. Os atletas contam com controlo eletr\u00f3nico de tempos por chip, seguro de prova, abastecimentos de s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, banhos quentes e almo\u00e7o de conv\u00edvio opcional.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: