1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o:<\/strong> 5.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e a localiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Mangualde Trail \u2013 Desafio dos Santos 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no concelho de Mangualde, distrito de Viseu.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios das partidas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Longo (25 km) tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00, seguido pelo Trail Curto (15 km) \u00e0s 09:05 e pelo Mini-Trail e Caminhada (ambos de 8 km) \u00e0s 09:10.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O evento pontua para algum trof\u00e9u ou circuito oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o Mangualde Trail integra formalmente o Circuito de Trail da Beira Alta \u2013 VI(r)VER BEIRA ALTA, constituindo a 8\u00aa etapa pontu\u00e1vel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o nas v\u00e1rias dist\u00e2ncias?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As taxas de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o de 15,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo de 25 km, 10,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto de 15 km, 6,00 \u20ac no Mini-Trail de 8 km e 5,00 \u20ac na Caminhada de 8 km at\u00e9 ao encerramento a 18 de outubro.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de atleta e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal oficial com chip de cronometragem, pr\u00e9mio finisher, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos no percurso e meta, balne\u00e1rios com duches e op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o por 6,00 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Mangualde Trail \u2013 Desafio dos Santos 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Mangualde\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Mangualde\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Montanha Clube Mangualde e Munic\u00edpio de Mangualde\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e a localiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Mangualde Trail \u2013 Desafio dos Santos 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no concelho de Mangualde, distrito de Viseu.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os hor\u00e1rios das partidas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail Longo (25 km) tem in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:00, seguido pelo Trail Curto (15 km) \u00e0s 09:05 e pelo Mini-Trail e Caminhada (ambos de 8 km) \u00e0s 09:10.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O evento pontua para algum trof\u00e9u ou circuito oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o Mangualde Trail integra formalmente o Circuito de Trail da Beira Alta \u2013 VI(r)VER BEIRA ALTA, constituindo a 8\u00aa etapa pontu\u00e1vel.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o nas v\u00e1rias dist\u00e2ncias?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As taxas de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o de 15,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo de 25 km, 10,00 \u20ac no Trail Curto de 15 km, 6,00 \u20ac no Mini-Trail de 8 km e 5,00 \u20ac na Caminhada de 8 km at\u00e9 ao encerramento a 18 de outubro.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de atleta e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal oficial com chip de cronometragem, pr\u00e9mio finisher, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos no percurso e meta, balne\u00e1rios com duches e op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o por 6,00 \u20ac.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68619,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[726,820,102],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47893","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-mangualde-viseu","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-viseu"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-mangualde-trail-desafio-dos-santos.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/47893","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}